          "key": "\uD83D\uDEA8Adicione aos Amigos a conta\u00A0- \u003E\u00A0**hypercircuitvvnH**\n\nLink do Servidor:\n\uD83D\uDC49 https://www.roblox.com/share?code=ce2158f3669d6e4989ff1cbcadb28db3\u0026type=Server\n\n![](https://storage.crisp.chat/users/website/website/-/3/8/3/0/3830eb7e676b2c00/robloxplayerbetav3abhfrkyb_1aerjig.png)\n**N\u00E3o esque\u00E7a de conferir se seu inventario est\u00E1 cheio**\n{Enter}",
