          "key": "\uD83D\uDE4B\u200D\u2642\uFE0F Ol\u00E1, siga as instru\u00E7\u00F5es para receber seu pedido:\n\n1. Aceitar pedido de amizade da conta -\u003E **{Clipboard:upper}**\n\n2. Colocar alguma unidade para vender no TRADING PLAZA\n\n3. Avisar quando poder entrar e comprar sua unidade!{Enter}",
          "x": 0,
          "y": 0,
          "delay": 300,
          "comment": "",
          "imagePath": null,
          "timeout": 5000,
          "confidence": 0.8,
          "keyHtml": "\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022white-space:pre-wrap;\u0022\u003E\uD83D\uDE4B\u200D\u2642\uFE0F Ol\u00E1, siga as instru\u00E7\u00F5es para receber seu pedido:\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022white-space:pre-wrap;\u0022\u003E1. Aceitar pedido de amizade da conta -\u0026gt; **\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan data-token=\u0022{Clipboard:upper}\u0022\u003E{Clipboard:upper}\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022white-space:pre-wrap;\u0022\u003E**\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022white-space:pre-wrap;\u0022\u003E2. Colocar alguma unidade para vender no \u003C/span\u003E\u003Cb\u003E\u003Cstrong style=\u0022white-space:pre-wrap;\u0022\u003ETRADING PLAZA\u003C/strong\u003E\u003C/b\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\u003C/p\u003E\u003Cp\u003E\u003Cspan style=\u0022white-space:pre-wrap;\u0022\u003E3. Avisar quando poder entrar e comprar sua unidade!\u003C/span\u003E\u003Cspan data-token=\u0022{Enter}\u0022\u003E{Enter}\u003C/span\u003E\u003C/p\u003E",
          "keyMarkdown": "\uD83D\uDE4B\u200D\u2642\uFE0F Ol\u00E1, siga as instru\u00E7\u00F5es para receber seu pedido:\n\n1. Aceitar pedido de amizade da conta -\u003E **{Clipboard:upper}**\n\n2. Colocar alguma unidade para vender no *TRADING PLAZA*\n\n3. Avisar quando poder entrar e comprar sua unidade!{Enter}",
          "repeatCount": 1,
          "holdDurationMs": 0
        }
      ],
